---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy - Cosmetiqly" description="Cosmetiqly Privacy Policy explaining data collection, cookies, and AdSense publisher policies.">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 md:py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold font-outfit text-white mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-4">
      <p>Last updated: August 2, 2026</p>
      <p>At <strong>Cosmetiqly.com</strong>, available from https://cosmetiqly.com, one of our main priorities is the privacy of our visitors. This Privacy Policy document contains types of information that is collected and recorded by Cosmetiqly and how we use it.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mt-6">1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>Cosmetiqly does not require account creation or personal user registration to access our 1,000,000+ ingredient safety database. Standard web server log files may record IP addresses, browser types, Internet Service Providers (ISP), referring pages, and date/time stamps for security and traffic analytics.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mt-6">2. Cookies and Google AdSense</h2>
      <p>Cosmetiqly uses standard browser cookies to store user preferences and search settings. Google AdSense and third-party vendors use DART cookies to serve relevant advertisements based on user visits to Cosmetiqly.com and other websites on the internet.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mt-6">3. Third Party Privacy Policies</h2>
      <p>Cosmetiqly's Privacy Policy does not apply to other advertisers or websites. We advise you to consult the respective Privacy Policies of these third-party ad servers for more detailed information.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mt-6">4. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>If you have additional questions or require more information about our Privacy Policy, do not hesitate to contact us at <a href="mailto:support@cosmetiqly.com" class="text-rose-400">support@cosmetiqly.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
